    "text": "For any <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the sum of all the solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, is equal to",
